WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The whole room can't hold it anymore

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Rescue doesn't care about ordinary people at all

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
That's more than thirty degrees

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
No heating equipment at all

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The food stored at home is at the bottom

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
It’s impossible to go out and sell things

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Aunt Lin

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
You said before that you don’t need to stock up.

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
There is a water and power outage right now

10
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,000
You think of a way

11
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,190
The power plant can't bear it anymore

12
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:20,480
No one is repairing it now

13
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,480
No one knows

14
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,740
We can only save our own lives

15
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,740
When will parents come back?

16
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,740
Return immediately

17
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,740
Grandma protects you

18
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,630
Don't panic, everyone

19
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:31,630
Repair personnel are on the way

20
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,630
Now everyone cooperates to hand over excess supplies

21
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:34,630
Uncooperative

22
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:36,630
It will be handed over to the official for processing later.

23
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,630
They will only take the police out of the house

24
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:39,630
Just putting on airs

25
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,630
It’s not about supplies that save lives

26
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:42,630
Who is willing to hand it over for free?

27
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:43,630
This is just to fool them.

28
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,630
Electricity has no semi-electrical effect on me

29
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:46,630
Hundreds of tons of water storage

30
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,630
Sufficient fuel

31
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:48,630
Suitable for heating

32
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:49,630
All are enough
